        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Voided velvet cushion cover, with a floral pattern in red and green silk pile on a white ground enhanced with an additional weft of silver strip wound around a white silk core.\nThere is a relatively small, central, multi-petalled rosette surrounded by eight large tulip heads and many small rose buds.  At each corner there is a diagonal spray of small pomegranate fruit and a rose bud.  At either end of the cover there is a six-lappet border, each containing a stylised rose bud."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8258d08e-8289-3bde-9acf-749adadacabe> .

