        ecrm:P126_employed      "gold.  S Tightness of wrap.  Tightly.  Selvedges: dimensions 2 cm.  Satin, as foundation."@en , "silk pile on a white ground enhanced with an additional weft of silver strip wound around a white silk core.  Satin foundation structure 4/1 satin"@en , "silk: yellow.  Weft: cotton, 1 ply ivory.  Satin and velvet warp order 3-1-2.  Velvet structure: silk."@en , "red and green"@en , "Metal and twist: gilt"@en , "4/1 twill, count 16.  Shots between pile 2"@en , "S-twist.  Pile counts, warps 10, along weft 9.  Binding weft threads: silk, super-skinny white filament.  Brocade structure: wholly brocaded? whole"@en ;
